    "title": "Bobbi Douglas leaves legacy of growth at OneEighty - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Submitted ,\n18 hours ago After 44 years filled with service to the community through her dedication to OneEighty and beyond, Executive Director Bobbi Douglas is retiring. “So many people took the time to reach out to me with words of thanks, kindness and good wishes for the next chapter in my life,\" Douglas said. \"I am unable to put into words how much each message has touched me. But it is the conversations from the individuals whose lives have been impacted through our efforts here at OneEighty that have meant so much to me.” Read full article\n1",
